  "dct_description_sm": [
    "The main objective of this data set is to determine important feeding grounds using stable isotopes of bowhead whales and their potential preys (zooplankton). We suspect that feeding is tightly related with the timing of the primary and secondary production, which varies both spatially and temporarily in the Arctic. We also wanted to determine the trophic level of bowhead whale across the area of study."
  ],
